diagnostics/list-while-portions.em:3:13: Dict[String, Int] has no method `take_while`
  ["Ada": 12].take_while { (name, age) => true }
              ^^^^^^^^^^
A dictionary has `count`, `empty?`, `each`, `map`, `contains_key?`, `contains_value?`, `keys`, `values`, `entries`, `remove`, and `merge`, and is looked up with `[key]`.
